    'about-wine-h3':        'Wine',
    'about-wine-p':         '20+ varietals: Chardonnay, Sauvignon Blanc, Pinot Noir, Cabernet Sauvignon, Riesling, Champagne, and more.',
    'about-whiskey-h3':     'Whisky',
